<title>USA: Control Data Systems Corp Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Control Data Systems Corp Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ARDEN HILLS, Minn. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997	     1996</p>
<p> Total Revenues				$ 60,953	$ 78,254</p>
<p> Total Cost of Revenues			39,800	  52,588</p>
<p> Gross Profit				    21,153	  25,666</p>
<p>Operating Expenses:</p>
<p>Selling, General and</p>
<p>   Administrative				17,893	  21,409</p>
<p> Technical					  3,732	   3,260</p>
<p>    Total Operating Expenses		 21,625	  24,669</p>
<p>    (Loss) Earnings from Operations	 (472)	     997</p>
<p>Nonoperating Income (Expenses):</p>
<p>  Interest Expense				 (27)	   (112)</p>
<p>  Interest Income				 1,280	   1,207</p>
<p>  Gain on Sale of Business		   15,000		 -</p>
<p>  Other Income, Net			     1,119	   1,186</p>
<p>    Total Nonoperating Income, Net	 17,372	   2,281</p>
<p>    Earnings Before Income Taxes	   16,900	   3,278</p>
<p> Provision for Income Taxes		     300	     400</p>
<p>    Net Earnings				 16,600	   2,878</p>
<p>Primary Earnings per Common</p>
<p>  Share and Common Share Equivalents	 1.19	    0.20</p>
<p>Fully Diluted Earnings per</p>
<p>Common Share and Common</p>
<p>  Share Equivalents				1.19	    0.20</p>
<p>Weighted Average Common Shares</p>
<p>Outstanding (in thousands)</p>
<p>  Primary					  13,950	  14,287</p>
<p>  Fully Diluted				  13,950	  14,310</p>
<p>	  (Dollars in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q1 net includes gain from the sale of the company's 50-percent stake in Metaphase Technology and its product data management (PDM) sales and service channel of $15 million or $1.08 per share; and an in-process research and development charge of $0.5 million associated with the purchase of software from Attachmate Corp, which closed on March 19, 1997.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
